SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ppaaxx utility is compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”)
     specification, except that the ppaaxx archive format is only partially sup‐
     ported, and the lliissttoopptt keyword is unsupported.

     The flags [--00BBDDEEGGjjOOPPTTUUYYZZzz], the archive formats bbccppiioo, ssvv44ccppiioo, ssvv44ccrrcc,
     and ttaarr, the bb, kk, and xx additions to the --bb flag, and the flawed archive
     handling during list and read operations are extensions to that specifi‐
     cation.

